#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "100_Kiryu"
msgid "Yasuko-san. You keep saying you owe Taiga your life."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "112_Kiryu"
msgid "And I get it. We all rely on other people. It's hard to keep\\r\ngoing without someone loving you, supporting you, pushing you onward."
msgstr "Y lo entiendo. Todos dependemos de otras personas. Es difícil\\r seguir adelante sin alguien que te quiera, te apoye y te impulse a seguir adelante."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "124_Kiryu"
msgid "But in your case, Taiga became more than that. He's not just\\r\nyour support. He's your reason to keep living."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "136_Yasuko"
msgid "I..."
msgstr "Yo..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "148_Kiryu"
msgid "I know life hasn't been easy for you. Losing your parents is\\r\none of the worst pains imaginable, and you had to bear that\\r\nburden at a far younger age than most."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "160_Kiryu"
msgid "But having a hard life doesn't excuse the way you've lived."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "172_Yasuko"
msgid "Ngh..."
msgstr "Ngh..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "184_Kiryu"
msgid "Not that I have any right to talk. I've made my fair share\\r\nof mistakes."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "196_Date"
msgid "Kiryu..."
msgstr "Kiryu..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "208_Yasuko"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "220_Kiryu"
msgid "I understand why you feel so strongly, but that emotion has\\r\nled you to some bad decisions."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "232_Kiryu"
msgid "It's not a stretch to say it's completely clouded your judgment."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "244_Kiryu"
msgid "So, I need you to stay here while I go figure out where your\\r\nbrother is. It's for your own good."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "256_Yasuko"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Pero..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "268_Date"
msgid "Kiryu..."
msgstr "Kiryu..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "280_Kiryu"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll find him. And I'll make sure you two are\\r\nreunited. I promise."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "292_Kiryu"
msgid "But for now, you just need to be patient. Okay?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "304_Yasuko"
msgid "...Yes. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "316_Kiryu"
msgid "Thank you, Yasuko-san."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "340_Kiryu"
msgid "Take care of her for me, will you?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "352_Date"
msgid "Heh, do you even have to ask?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "412_Yasuko"
msgid "So, what is it you want to ask me?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "424_Kiryu"
msgid "Sorry if this is a blunt question..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "436_Kiryu"
msgid "But why do you need to see your brother so bad? Bad enough\\r\nto murder for it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "448_Date"
msgid "Wait, you what!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "460_Yasuko"
msgid "Kiryu-san, is this really the best place to..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "472_Kiryu"
msgid "Don't worry about Date-san. He's an ex-detective, yeah, but\\r\nwe can trust him. I promise."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "484_Kiryu"
msgid "He'd never turn you in without hearing what you had to say\\r\nfirst."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "496_Kiryu"
msgid "Isn't that right, Date-san?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "508_Date"
msgid "Well, uh... Yeah, that's right."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "520_Kiryu"
msgid "Now tell me the truth, Yasuko-san. Why would you go so far\\r\nfor your brother?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "532_Yasuko"
msgid "I..."
msgstr "Yo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "544_Kiryu"
msgid "Yasuko-san."
msgstr "Yasuko-san."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "556_Date"
msgid "C'mon."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "568_Yasuko"
msgid "It's because... because Taiga is everything to me. I owe him\\r\nmy life."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "580_Kiryu"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "592_Yasuko"
msgid "I'm serious. If it weren't for him, I would have died years\\r\nago."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "604_Kiryu"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr "Dime."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "616_Yasuko"
msgid "Have you ever heard of a living-donor kidney transplant?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "628_Date"
msgid "Oh yeah, you read about those things all the time. That's\\r\nwhen they give you a kidney from one of your relatives,\\r\nright? They say you only need one, after all."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "640_Yasuko"
msgid "Right. The truth of it is... I'm the recipient of one of those\\r\nliving-donor transplants."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "652_Date"
msgid "And your brother's the one who gave it to you, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "664_Kiryu"
msgid "That's what you meant when you said you owe him your life."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "676_Yasuko"
msgid "...Yes."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "688_Date"
msgid "Hold on. Getting a transplant like that from your sibling\\r\nisn't all that uncommon."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "700_Date"
msgid "I'm not judging or anything, but do you really owe him that\\r\nmuch just for a kidney?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "712_Yasuko"
msgid "It's not that simple."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "724_Kiryu"
msgid "Think you can explain?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "736_Yasuko"
msgid "The kidney I got... It wasn't Taiga's. He wasn't a match."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "748_Date"
msgid "What, different blood types?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "760_Yasuko"
msgid "Well, yes, but..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "772_Date"
msgid "But what? Why couldn't you get the transplant from your brother?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "784_Kiryu"
msgid "...Yasuko-san?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "796_Yasuko"
msgid "I, um..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "808_Kiryu"
msgid "I think I get what's going on here. You and Taiga aren't\\r\nactually siblings."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "820_Date"
msgid "Kiryu!"
msgstr "¡Kiryu!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "832_Yasuko"
msgid "He's right. Taiga is my stepfather's son from his prior\\r\nmarriage, while my mother had me before she and my\\r\nstepfather ever even met."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "844_Date"
msgid "Then where'd you find a match?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "856_Yasuko"
msgid "Since my mother had already passed... Taiga tracked down my\\r\nbiological father and begged him to donate his kidney to me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "868_Kiryu"
msgid "Saejima..."
msgstr "Saejima..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "880_Yasuko"
msgid "Beyond the regular difficulty of finding a kidney donor, my\\r\nblood type is extremely rare. A direct relative was my only\\r\nhope of a match."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "892_Yasuko"
msgid "Once Taiga learned that, he spent every waking moment of his\\r\nlife scouring the city until he found my father."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "904_Yasuko"
msgid "He was only 15 years old at the time."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "916_Date"
msgid "Still just a kid, huh..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "928_Yasuko"
msgid "I had honestly given up hope. Before my mother died, she\\r\ntold me my father was nothing more than an abusive drunk\\r\nwith no chance of ever changing."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "940_Yasuko"
msgid "Based on what I knew, it seemed likely he was already dead.\\r\nEven if he wasn't, I didn't want to live knowing I owed my\\r\nlife to such a horrible man."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "952_Yasuko"
msgid "At the time, I would have rather died than continue on\\r\ncarrying a part of him inside me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "964_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "976_Yasuko"
msgid "But Taiga wouldn't take no for an answer. He said no matter\\r\nwhat happened, he would take care of me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "988_Date"
msgid "Then... he found your dad?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1000_Yasuko"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Sí."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1012_Date"
msgid "Well? Where was he?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1024_Yasuko"
msgid "In Kansai. He had started working for a yakuza organization\\r\ncalled the Omi Alliance. Handling the dirty jobs nobody else\\r\nwanted to touch."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1036_Date"
msgid "The Omi!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1048_Yasuko"
msgid "That's right. Taiga went alone to Kansai, knowing full well\\r\nthat my father was a yakuza, but..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1060_Kiryu"
msgid "Let me guess. They tried to extort him."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1072_Yasuko"
msgid "Exactly. A yakuza through and through, my father demanded\\r\na massive sum of money in exchange for one of his kidneys."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1084_Date"
msgid "How much cash are we talking here?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1096_Yasuko"
msgid "Thirty million yen."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1108_Date"
msgid "Thirty mil!? That's a ton now, but it was a fortune back then! How was a kid ever supposed to get his hands on that kind of money!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1120_Yasuko"
msgid "He wasn't. That was the point."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1132_Yasuko"
msgid "But Taiga didn't give up. He started fighting thugs in the\\r\nstreets of Kamurocho, trying to scrape together whatever\\r\nfunds he could."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1144_Date"
msgid "That would never work. Not for cash like that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1156_Yasuko"
msgid "It didn't. Not until Sasai-san from the Tojo Clan stepped\\r\nin."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1168_Yasuko"
msgid "He gave Taiga the thirty million under one condition: he\\r\njoin the Sasai Family."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1180_Kiryu"
msgid "So that's how he ended up in the Tojo."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1192_Yasuko"
msgid "All that time, Taiga never turned his back to me. Even when\\r\nit seemed like all hope was lost, he supported me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1204_Yasuko"
msgid "He dropped out of high school, gave up on his dream of\\r\nbecoming a teacher, even joined the yakuza for me..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1216_Kiryu"
msgid "So that's what you meant when you said you owe him your\\r\nlife."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1228_Yasuko"
msgid "That's right. He's everything to me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1240_Yasuko"
msgid "Not only did Taiga literally save my life, but he gave me\\r\nthe will to keep on living."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1252_Kiryu"
msgid "Yasuko-san..."
msgstr "Yasuko-san..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1276_Date"
msgid "What's going on, Kiryu? You show up in a guy's bar and don't even drop him a line first?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1288_Kiryu"
msgid "Sorry for not letting you know, Date-san. I have some business in town."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1300_Date"
msgid "...Work never ends for the ex-fourth chairman, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1312_Kiryu"
msgid "You've got that right. Anyway, this is Yasuko Saejima. I'm\\r\nhere helping her with a little something."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1324_Yasuko"
msgid "It's nice to meet you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1336_Date"
msgid "Oh, the pleasure's all mine."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1348_Date"
msgid "She's a knockout, Kiryu. How'd you end up bringing a girl\\r\nlike her back here, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1360_Kiryu"
msgid "Whatever you're thinking, I guarantee you've got the wrong\\r\nidea. Let's leave it at that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1372_Kiryu"
msgid "By the way, where's Mama?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1384_Date"
msgid "Gone for the week. Family trouble, you know how it goes."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1396_Kiryu"
msgid "And you're holding down the fort while she's gone?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1408_Date"
msgid "Yup. It's a real pain, what with my other work and all, but\\r\nshe insists we keep it open for the regulars."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1420_Kiryu"
msgid "Lucky for us that she does."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1432_Date"
msgid "Now, Kiryu. What's this \"little something\" you need to take\\r\ncare of?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1444_Kiryu"
msgid "Oh, right. You mind taking a seat, Yasuko-san?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1456_Yasuko"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr "Em..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1468_Kiryu"
msgid "Please. I just need to ask you something before we head out\\r\nto find your brother."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1480_Yasuko"
msgid "...Okay."
msgstr "...Bien."

